            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1413] If the EVCC sends a valid parameter EVPowerProfile (as defined in [V2G20-1070]) in the message PowerDeliveryReq the SECC shall ensure that the power envelope defined by the PowerSchedule in the ChargingSchedule as well as, if present, the DischargingSchedule, can be utilized for the entire time span which they cover.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                973,
                1053,
                1078
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    973.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    973.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    1078.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    1078.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1009] As soon as the SECC becomes aware of the fact that [V2G20-1413] can no longer be satisfied it shall trigger a proper schedule renegotiation procedure.",
            "block_bbox": [
                69,
                1100,
                1052,
                1155
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    69.0,
                    1100.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    1100.0
                ],
                [
                    1052.0,
                    1155.0
                ],
                [
                    69.0,
                    1155.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1402] When the SECC wants to trigger a termination of the session, it shall set the parameter EVSENotification to \"Terminate\" and send the parameter until the awaited action has been processed by the EV.",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                1176,
                1053,
                1253
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    68.0,
                    1176.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    1176.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    1253.0
                ],
                [
                    68.0,
                    1253.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1414] If the EVCC sends PowerDeliveryReq with ChargeProgress=Renegotiate it shall not send an EVPowerProfile.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
                1277,
                1053,
                1329
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 8,
