            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 2 After indication of a terminate the SECC can stop the charging from EVSE side, e.g. by turning-off the pilot signal or opening the main contactors after the duration of NotificationMaxDelay.",
